{"id":"705c3caaeb653647","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-metric-quotient-space.md","title":"ZFC Metric Quotient Space","display":"df-zfc-metric-quotient-space — ZFC Metric Quotient Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-quotient-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-quotient-space"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-quotient-space — ZFC Metric Quotient Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric]]","[[58-df-quotient]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-quotient-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-quotient-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-quotient-space — ZFC Metric Quotient Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"58-df-quotient\">58-df-quotient</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (metric-space carrier)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(d:X\\times X\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (metric)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(E\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (equivalence relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in V\">\\(Q\\in V\\)</span> 为商载体候选；其全部等价类由 Assertion 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\)</span> 确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:X\\to Q\">\\(\\pi:X\\to Q\\)</span> (quotient map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span> (quotient topology)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq Q\">\\(U\\subseteq Q\\)</span> (set tested for quotient openness)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (source predicates).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S(O,X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S(O,X,d)\\)</span> (metric-open predicate defined here).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricQuotientSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricQuotientSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\in V\">\\(O\\in V\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 保持上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times X\">\\(X\\times X\\)</span> 上非负实值函数的输入约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x,y)\">\\(d(x,y)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(d(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S(O,X,d)\\leftrightarrow O\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x\\in O\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in O)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S(O,X,d)\\leftrightarrow O\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x\\in O\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in O)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricQuotientSpace}_S(Q,X,d,E,\\pi,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,X,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,Q)\\land\\pi=\\{\\langle x,\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq Q:\\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S(\\pi^{-1}[U],X,d)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricQuotientSpace}_S(Q,X,d,E,\\pi,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,X,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,Q)\\land\\pi=\\{\\langle x,\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq Q:\\mathrm{MetricOpen}_S(\\pi^{-1}[U],X,d)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the quotient topology induced from the metric topology; no metric on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> is asserted unless extra compatibility hypotheses are supplied.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-met